'''Inky Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event/Event Gacha|Event Gacha]] during the [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 868
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Inky Cat
|name2 = Inky Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Inky Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
A specialist meatshield tailored to [[:Category:Explosion Enemies|Explosion enemies]]. It actually has good matchups across the board, trivializing much of [[Journey to Talent (Bahamut Cat)|Journey to Talent]], while being useful against [[Xenobeast Bunaglios]] and [[Poultrio]], who rely on said pierce. Outside of this niche, it is a worse, more expensive version of [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]].

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

